    "seo_content": {
      "type": "seo-content",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "ZEENE Lifestyle — Premium Everyday Essentials in Pakistan",
        "content": "<p>ZEENE Lifestyle is a Pakistani apparel brand built on one idea: everyday essentials should look premium, feel comfortable, and stay within reach. From hoodies and t-shirts to tracksuits, joggers, and accessories, every piece is made for how people actually dress in Pakistan — at university, at work, at the gym, and everywhere in between.</p><p>Instead of chasing trends that fade in a season, ZEENE focuses on the pieces you reach for again and again: the hoodie that survives every winter, the tee that holds its shape after twenty washes, the joggers you wear from the gym to the grocery store. Honest fabric, honest fit, honest pricing.</p><h3>Shop by Category</h3><p><strong>Upperwear</strong> covers our core range — premium tees, drop shoulder tees, graphic tees, and plain tees, alongside classic and performance polo shirts, pullover and zip hoodies, fleece hoodies, sweatshirts, and top tanks.</p><p><strong>Bottom Wear</strong> brings together tracksuits, joggers, cargo pants, baggy trousers, shorts, and performance bottoms — built for movement, cut for everyday wear.</p><p><strong>Accessories</strong> finishes the look with leather belts and wallets, while our <strong>Seasonal Collection</strong> splits into lightweight summer essentials and warm winter layering pieces.</p><h3>Built for the Pakistani Climate</h3><p>Clothing that works in Karachi's humidity is not the same clothing that works through an Islamabad winter. That is why our range is split seasonally: breathable cotton tees, polos, and lightweight essentials for summer, and fleece hoodies, sweatshirts, and winter tracksuits when the temperature drops.</p><h3>Shop Online Across Pakistan</h3><p>ZEENE Lifestyle ships nationwide — Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Multan, Peshawar, and beyond. Wherever you order from, you get the same range, the same pricing, and the same support.</p><h3>Why Shop with ZEENE</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Free delivery</strong> on all orders across Pakistan</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cash on delivery</strong> — pay when your order reaches you</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy returns</strong> if the fit or the piece is not right</li>\n</ul><p>New drops land regularly in New Arrivals, and our Sale section is where you will find the best value across hoodies, tees, tracksuits, and more. Browse the full range and find the essentials you will actually wear.</p>",
        "collapsed_height": 180,
        "more_label": "Read More",
        "less_label": "Read Less",
        "max_width": 1280,
        "bg_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#0a0a0a",
        "button_bg": "#0a0a0a",
        "button_text": "#ffffff",
        "padding_top": 8,
        "padding_bottom": 48
      }
    },
